From 2756f724ddc5ebe20cda148f189da905ca8345b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:29:17 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(xtask): Gate maps name the crate a moved module lives
 in

134 app suites named modules that M4.1 moved out of app as app::<module>,
so quick never selected them for a change in post, sim or motion (a
post/mod.rs change picked 3 of 33 post suites). Rewrite the headers to
<crate>::<module>, give heidenhain_cycles a map, and pin the selection
with xtask tests that read the real headers.

Bumps PROCESS_VERSION to 17 (xtask changed).

Fixes #922

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL
